  m_Name: Story_gus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: gus
  title: Eleni's Song
  summary: 'Gus heckles everyone because he''s lonely. He''s a widower; Tariq''s songs remind him of his late wife Eleni. He built the first Sterling tower to pay her hospital bills, which ended his partnership with Walt. Fork: how he makes it up to Walt.'
  pathAName: Say it to his face
  pathBName: Fix his fence instead
  parts:
  - title: How I would have built it
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - You want advice? Free advice? Your barn door. It sticks, I can hear it from here.
    - Plane a millimetre off the bottom, and put the hinge pins in with a bit of candle wax. I'd do it myself. I'm retired. I just like telling people.
    happy: 0
